turn back the clock several years.  we bought all our DEC 3000/400s with
32M of ram.  we very quickly had to upgrade to 64M because "the alpha is
an absolute memory hog with its 64bit stuff, compared to our sparc20s,
hp 7xx, intel 486, etc".

