If the process is started as a detached process via a RUN/DETACH or
$CREPRC call then modify the command to supply the largest pagefile
quota you'd like to allow the process to have.  If you don't specify it
then the process will get it from the higher of PQL_D or PQL_M params
for it (unless of course the AUTH flag is set in which case it'll get it
from the UAF for the username of the process creating the detached
process).

