and SCSI-narrow controllers, and a B-400X expansion chassis, with,
apparently, nothing in it.  No cables; most notably including the MMJ
console cable, but I've found Chuck's House of VAX, which has a pointer
to, among other things, a chart showing the pinouts I need to hook a
console up to that.  Both are in B-213 cases.  (See, I know better than
not to do my homework before posting something like this *here*...)

