Michael McGarry wrote:
> 
> Hi,
> 
> Does anyone know how to configure the resolver on an ULTRIX workstation?
> 
> Regards,
> Michael

/etc/svc.conf lets you configure the services (e.g., local, bind) for
order of host lookup
Use the script svcsetup to let the system do it for you.

/etc/resolv.conf is the usual (see Bind and DNS book for general
discussions) resolver config file; put
your local domain and list of name servers in here. The man page
explains the format.
Again, a script, 'bindsetup' will do it all for you.
The man page will show it for you.


