  I will assume this is a reference to the VAXstation 3520 series, as 
  I am unaware of a VAX 3520 system.

  The VAXstation 3520 (dual CPU) and VAXstation 3540 (quad CPU) series 
  are SMP CVAX-based workstation systems, and occasionally known by the 
  project codename Firefox.  These systems use a backplane known as the 
  M-bus, and optionally offered a Q-bus adapter (three slots?) for use 
